  "details": "In worlds built with the latest SDK, on 1304 (and potentially earlier clients), **non-VRCUrl** (bog-standard) Unity UI InputFields no longer trigger the VRC keyboard.\n\nThe InputField **does receive focus**, as indicated by the blinking text cursor, and the highlight of existing text in the field, if any, and the change of pointer highlight and selection colors based on its Selectable properties.\n\nNo keyboard is displayed.\n\nHappens on all current platforms.",
